cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If VIO helps your education or research, please cite the project repository."
title: "VIO — An Open-Source Violin Practice Toolkit"
type: software
authors:
  - name: Anuppaul
repository-code: "https://github.com/Anuppaul/vio"
url: "https://github.com/Anuppaul/vio"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Independent violin practice tools for live pitch detection, tuning,
  swara and scale practice, Tanpura, ear training, note exercises and
  metronome. The MIT license applies to original source code;
  bundled third-party sound recordings may have separate or unresolved rights.
keywords:
  - violin
  - music education
  - pitch detection
  - ear training
  - metronome
  - android
